IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `oas-core`

-- Old Age Security Act, Part IV, "Availability of Information" (ss 33 and 33.1), "Form of Documents" (s 35) and "Benefits" (s 35.1).
-- Sections 34 and 34.2 (the Governor in Council's power to make regulations) are inert; see NOTES.md, "Coverage table".
-- Hohfeld: the three bodies in s 33.1 each have a privilege to make information available despite any other law, and the person the
-- information is about has no right that they not (the no-right correlative); the Minister's power in s 35.1 to require a person to attend is
-- the person's liability, and the person's duty to be there is the Minister's claim.

§ `Definitions`

-- s 33(1) "administration": "includes" the four named activities; other activities may also be administration, so the rest is an input.
-- "includes" is not exhaustive, so the activities beyond the four named are an input (fork OA1-F22 of NOTES.md).
-- src:897 | administration includes the development, operation, evaluation and enforcement of policies and programs. (mise en oeuvre)
@ref R.S.C., 1985, c. O-9, s 33(1) "administration" (src:897)
GIVEN `the activity is the development, operation, evaluation or enforcement of a policy or program` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the activity is otherwise administration` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 33(1): the activity is administration` `the activity is the development, operation, evaluation or enforcement of a policy or program` `the activity is otherwise administration` MEANS
        `the activity is the development, operation, evaluation or enforcement of a policy or program`
    OR  `the activity is otherwise administration`

-- src:898 | federal institution means a department or any other body referred to in Schedule I, I.1, II or III to the Financial Administration Act. (institution fédérale)
@ref R.S.C., 1985, c. O-9, s 33(1) "federal institution" (src:898)
GIVEN `the body is a department or any other body referred to in Schedule I, I.1, II or III to the Financial Administration Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 33(1): the body is a federal institution` `the body is a department or any other body referred to in Schedule I, I.1, II or III to the Financial Administration Act` MEANS
    `the body is a department or any other body referred to in Schedule I, I.1, II or III to the Financial Administration Act`

-- src:899 | public officer means an officer or employee of a federal institution, or a prescribed individual or a member of a prescribed class of individuals. (fonctionnaire public)
@ref R.S.C., 1985, c. O-9, s 33(1) "public officer" (src:899)
GIVEN `the individual is an officer or employee of a federal institution` IS A BOOLEAN
      -- out of range: section 2(3) (piece oa3): Regulations, "prescribed individual"
      `the individual is a prescribed individual or a member of a prescribed class of individuals` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 33(1): the individual is a public officer` `the individual is an officer or employee of a federal institution` `the individual is a prescribed individual or a member of a prescribed class of individuals` MEANS
        `the individual is an officer or employee of a federal institution`
    OR  `the individual is a prescribed individual or a member of a prescribed class of individuals`

§ `Information obtained under other Acts`

-- s 33.1(a): the Minister of National Revenue, or a person designated, may make a report available "despite any other Act or law".
-- src:912 | 33.1 Despite any other Act or law,
-- src:913 | (a) the Minister of National Revenue or any person that he or she designates may make available to the Minister, or to a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development that is designated by the Minister, a report providing information that is available to the Minister of National Revenue, if the information is necessary for the administration of this Act;
@ref R.S.C., 1985, c. O-9, s 33.1(a) (src:912-913)
GIVEN `the report is made available by the Minister of National Revenue or a person that he or she designates` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the report is made available to the Minister, or to a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development that is designated by the Minister` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the report provides information that is available to the Minister of National Revenue` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information is necessary for the administration of this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 33.1(a): the report may be made available` `the report is made available by the Minister of National Revenue or a person that he or she designates` `the report is made available to the Minister, or to a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development that is designated by the Minister` `the report provides information that is available to the Minister of National Revenue` `the information is necessary for the administration of this Act` MEANS
        `the report is made available by the Minister of National Revenue or a person that he or she designates`
    AND `the report is made available to the Minister, or to a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development that is designated by the Minister`
    AND `the report provides information that is available to the Minister of National Revenue`
    AND `the information is necessary for the administration of this Act`

-- (b): the Minister of Citizenship and Immigration and officers and employees of that Department, information obtained in the administration
-- of the Citizenship Act or the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act.
-- src:914 | (b) the Minister of Citizenship and Immigration and officers and employees of the Department of Citizenship and Immigration may make available to the Minister, or to a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development, any information that was obtained in the administration of the Citizenship Act or the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act, if the information is necessary for the administration of this Act; and
@ref R.S.C., 1985, c. O-9, s 33.1(b) (src:914)
GIVEN `the information is made available by the Minister of Citizenship and Immigration or an officer or employee of the Department of Citizenship and Immigration` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information is made available to the Minister, or to a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information was obtained in the administration of the Citizenship Act or the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information is necessary for the administration of this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 33.1(b): the information may be made available` `the information is made available by the Minister of Citizenship and Immigration or an officer or employee of the Department of Citizenship and Immigration` `the information is made available to the Minister, or to a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development` `the information was obtained in the administration of the Citizenship Act or the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act` `the information is necessary for the administration of this Act` MEANS
        `the information is made available by the Minister of Citizenship and Immigration or an officer or employee of the Department of Citizenship and Immigration`
    AND `the information is made available to the Minister, or to a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development`
    AND `the information was obtained in the administration of the Citizenship Act or the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act`
    AND `the information is necessary for the administration of this Act`

-- (c): the Commissioner of Corrections or staff members of the Correctional Service of Canada, personal information obtained in the
-- administration of the Corrections and Conditional Release Act.
-- src:915 | (c) the Commissioner of Corrections or staff members of the Correctional Service of Canada may make available to the Minister or a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development any personal information that was obtained in the administration of the Corrections and Conditional Release Act, if the information is necessary for the administration of this Act.
@ref R.S.C., 1985, c. O-9, s 33.1(c) (src:915)
GIVEN `the personal information is made available by the Commissioner of Corrections or a staff member of the Correctional Service of Canada` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the personal information is made available to the Minister or a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the personal information was obtained in the administration of the Corrections and Conditional Release Act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information is necessary for the administration of this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 33.1(c): the personal information may be made available` `the personal information is made available by the Commissioner of Corrections or a staff member of the Correctional Service of Canada` `the personal information is made available to the Minister or a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development` `the personal information was obtained in the administration of the Corrections and Conditional Release Act` `the information is necessary for the administration of this Act` MEANS
        `the personal information is made available by the Commissioner of Corrections or a staff member of the Correctional Service of Canada`
    AND `the personal information is made available to the Minister or a public officer of the Department of Employment and Social Development`
    AND `the personal information was obtained in the administration of the Corrections and Conditional Release Act`
    AND `the information is necessary for the administration of this Act`

§ `Form of Documents`

-- s 35: "in such form as the Minister may require": if the Minister requires a form, the document is made or given in it.
-- src:952 | 35 Every application, statement or notification required or permitted by this Act shall be made or given in such form as the Minister may require.
@ref R.S.C., 1985, c. O-9, s 35 (src:952)
GIVEN `the Minister requires a form for the application, statement or notification` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the application, statement or notification is made or given in that form` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 35: the application, statement or notification is made or given as required` `the Minister requires a form for the application, statement or notification` `the application, statement or notification is made or given in that form` MEANS
        (NOT `the Minister requires a form for the application, statement or notification`)
    OR  `the application, statement or notification is made or given in that form`

§ `Benefits`

-- s 35.1: the Minister may require an applicant, another person or a group or class of persons to be at a suitable place at a suitable time to
-- make an application in person or to provide additional information about an application.
-- src:956 | 35.1 The Minister may require an applicant or other person or a group or class of persons to be at a suitable place at a suitable time in order to make an application for benefits in person or to provide additional information about an application.
@ref R.S.C., 1985, c. O-9, s 35.1 (src:956)
GIVEN `the Minister requires the person, or a group or class of persons that includes the person, to be at a place at a time` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the place is suitable` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the time is suitable` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the purpose is to make an application for benefits in person or to provide additional information about an application` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 35.1: the person is required to be at the place at the time` `the Minister requires the person, or a group or class of persons that includes the person, to be at a place at a time` `the place is suitable` `the time is suitable` `the purpose is to make an application for benefits in person or to provide additional information about an application` MEANS
        `the Minister requires the person, or a group or class of persons that includes the person, to be at a place at a time`
    AND `the place is suitable`
    AND `the time is suitable`
    AND `the purpose is to make an application for benefits in person or to provide additional information about an application`
